# Skill system source of truth

- Treat `SkillDataSO` as the only active and supported skill system.
- Do not add new gameplay features to the legacy `AbilityData` skill pipeline.
- When touching cast flows, prioritize `NewSkillSystemDefaultSkillCastFlow` and `SkillDataSO` paths.
- Legacy code may stay only for temporary build compatibility during migration.

# New skills

- New skills must be data-driven from `SkillDataSO`.
- Prefer reusable effect ScriptableObjects over per-skill custom C# behavior.
- Skill targeting must be configured through cast definitions (projectile/area/self), not inferred by ad-hoc logic.
